 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 5): the W and E fronts from w03-251s1/s2 (2024) and w04-71s1/s2 (2022): blue-grey metal panel cladding (panel joints, cladding from 0.15) with square two-light windows on a regular pitch, over a fully glazed ground storey 1.5 times an upper storey. The full-height (30 m) fronts are measured groups; the stepped lower blocks and returns take the same scheme as otherWalls.",
